# Stale copies of build-time and public files that still carry retired claims.
# These are not read by the build, but they must not be re-committed, and they
# must not be mistaken for live copy. (Individual claim strings are deliberately
# not repeated here, so that a plain text search of the repository returns only
# real copy, not this comment.)
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.timestamp-*.mjs

